Title: LocoCisco — Every Voice Understood

INT. CORPORATE CONFERENCE ROOM - DAY

A wide, balanced view looks down the length of a conference table. WEI, a Chinese man in his 50s, and MEI, a younger Chinese woman, sit together on the left in formal suits. ALEX, a man around 30, and JORDAN, a woman around 30, sit opposite in business casual blazers. Glass walls, daylight, laptops, and a printed deal sheet give the room a corporate look. Their faces show natural skin texture and subtle expressions. A small LOCOCISCO speaker and caption screen sit between the parties.

Whenever a person speaks, a thin rectangle frames their face and their first name appears directly beneath it. The overlay disappears when they stop speaking.

Mei glances at Wei. Wei gives a subtle nod.

WEI
(in Mandarin)
如果价格降百分之十，我们今天签约。

The English translation appears on the caption screen.

LOCOCISCO (V.O.)
If you reduce the price by ten percent, we can sign today.

Jordan leans close to Alex. His lips move in a whisper too faint to make out. A rectangle frames Jordan's face, with JORDAN beneath it. The caption screen stays blank and the speaker stays silent. Alex gives Jordan a slight nod.

ALEX
Agreed, if delivery starts next month.

The Mandarin translation appears on the caption screen.

LOCOCISCO (V.O.)
(in Mandarin)
同意，前提是下个月开始交付。

Wei and Mei exchange a brief look. Wei nods to Alex across the table.

ON SCREEN: "LocoCisco — Every voice understood."
